{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04406","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 三十二 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 三十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"索居犹几日，炎夏忽然衰。\n阳彩皆阴翳，亲友尽暌违。\n登山望不见，涕泣久涟洏。\n宿梦感颜色，若与白云期。\n马上骄豪子，驱逐正蚩蚩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}